#: ''Nuper erat medicus, nunc est vespillo Diaulus: <br> &nbsp;&nbsp;quod vespillo facit, fecerat et medicus.'' <br> (Lately was Diaulus a doctor, now he is an undertaker. What the undertaker now does the doctor too did before.) &mdash; [[w:Martial|Martial]] I.xlvii (translation by Walter Ker).

